  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Hatched in the radioactive glow of Subchain City's abandoned wrestling arena, 'El Pollo Loco' learned to brawl before he learned to swim. He witnessed his flock get liquidated in the Great DRIP Drought of '28 and now roams the wastes, fueled by spite and a burning desire for revenge against the whales who drained them dry.",
